"{\"summary\": \"The diff adds a `_line_part` helper in mcp.py that builds a nib location part from an entry's `file_path` and `line` (returning None when either is missing), and `graph_parts` calls it for the queried symbol and each result. `load_facts_file` gains a `symbols_only` keyword, and `_write_facts_symbols_for_read` now passes `symbols_only=True`.\", \"ranges\": [[295, 299], [312, 316], [10, 10], [999, 999]]}"